OL,4,BUkrainian FA to blame for failed drugs 
OL,5,Btest - Mudryk                          
OL,6,GOn-loan Tottenham winger Mykhailo      
OL,7,GMudryk says he blames the              
OL,8,Gadministration of the Ukraine national 
OL,9,Gteam for his failed drugs test and     
OL,10,Gsubsequent ban from football.          
OL,12,FThe 25-year-old, on a season-long loan 
OL,13,Ffrom Chelsea, was suspended from       
OL,14,FNovember 2024 until July 2026 after    
OL,15,Ftesting positive for the banned        
OL,16,Fsubstance meldonium, which he believes 
OL,17,Fentered his system while on            
OL,18,Finternational duty.                    
